{
  "slug": "tbh",
  "name": "Tbh",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin that guides you through building real systems alongside The Builder's Handbook (TBH) book series.\n\ntbh, you should build it yourself — and this plugin makes sure you can.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills** and **10 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `build-chapter` (Start or continue building a chapter's implementation), `explain` (Explain a concept from the current book in the context of what you've built so far), `help` (Show all available commands for The Builder's Handbook (TBH) plugin), `hint` (Get a targeted hint when you're stuck on the current chapter), `next` (Show what's next — your current progress and what chapter to tackle next), `review` (Review your chapter implementation against the spec), `setup` (Initialize TBH build-along environment), `status` (Show your current TBH book, chapter progress, and what to do next), and 2 more\n- **Commands** (10): `build-chapter` (Start or continue building a chapter's implementation), `explain` (Explain a concept from the current book in the context of what you've built so far), `help` (Show all available commands for The Builder's Handbook (TBH) plugin), `hint` (Get a targeted hint when you're stuck on the current chapter), `next` (Show what's next — your current progress and what chapter to tackle next), `review` (Review your chapter implementation against the spec), `setup` (Initialize TBH build-along environment), `status` (Show your current TBH book, chapter progress, and what to do next), and 2 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tbh@claude-community` from `tbhbooks/tbh-skill`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
